  {
    "id": 1006001001010010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "旅行雑誌だよ\r\n見知らぬ土地での新しい出会いもいいものだと思ってね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100101/1006001001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001010020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー、\r\nアナタはどこか行きたい場所はあるかな？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100101/1006001001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "行きたい場所か……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "海が見たい",
    "nextLabel": "1006001001011"
  },
  {
    "select": "大いなる山の頂",
    "nextLabel": "1006001001012"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "にぎやかな観光地",
    "nextLabel": "1006001001013"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001010030,
    "label": "1006001001011",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いいね、揺らめく波、照りつける太陽は人を開放的にする\r\n新しい出会いを求める場所としてはうってつけだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100101/1006001001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001010040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……それに、私も海を見るのは好きなんだ\r\n今度、一緒に見に行かないかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100101/1006001001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001010050,
    "label": "1006001001012",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "大いなる山の頂……？\r\n今に満足せず、さらに高みを求める……ということかな",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100101/1006001001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001010060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、アナタらしい答え方だ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100101/1006001001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001010070,
    "label": "1006001001013",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど、人がたくさんいるというのは良いね\r\nそれだけで、旅というものが楽しくなる気がするよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100101/1006001001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けど、たまには普段と違うような\r\n非日常的な場所も悪くはないと思ったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
